; Windows installer hooks (bundle.windows.nsis.installerHooks).
;
; Tauri's own file association writes the extension's default value, which makes Marxy the
; handler for that type. Only Markdown is left to it (tauri.windows.conf.json). Every other type
; the app has a page for is offered in "Open with" through OpenWithProgids and Applications\marxy.exe,
; and the extension's default value is never written. The list is openWithExtensions() in
; packages/core/src/kind/registry.ts less the Markdown ones; registry.test.ts holds the two equal.

!define MARXY_PROGID "Marxy.File"
!define MARXY_APP "Applications\marxy.exe"

!macro MARXY_EXTENSIONS ACTION
